+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2012 Justin Ruggles <justin.ruggles@gmail.com>
+ *
+ * Triangular with Noise Shaping is based on opusfile.
+ * Copyright (c) 1994-2012 by the Xiph.Org Foundation and contributors
