@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@
+/*
+ * RC4 encryption/decryption/pseudo-random number generator
+ * Copyright (c) 2007 Reimar Doeffinger
+ *
+ * loosely based on LibTomCrypt by Tom St Denis
+ *
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
